OL,3,GNEWSANurse passes maths GCSE after
OL,4,A40-year wait
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse says she is "over the moon" to
OL,7,Fhave passed her maths GCSE having tried
OL,8,Fagain after 40 years.
OL,10,FJoanne Mulholland, 56, from Gateshead,
OL,11,Flast re-sat her maths O-level in 1987
OL,12,Fand failed three times.
OL,14,FDespite going on to become a qualified
OL,15,Fnurse and achieving a master's degree,
OL,16,Fshe wanted to try again for her maths
OL,17,Fqualification and took evening classes.
OL,18,FThe mum "had a few tears" on Thursday
OL,19,Fmorning when discovering she had been
OL,20,Fawarded a passing mark of 4.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
